    "label": "1",
    "front": "1: Unchecked relationship ids (same bug class as the lesson).",
    "back": "`POST /api/daytask` writes `body.taskId` (`daytask/route.ts` line 37); `POST /api/widgets` writes `body.goalId` (`widgets/route.ts` lines 30-35); `POST /api/projects` and `PATCH /api/projects/[id]` write `areaId` (`projects/route.ts` line 46, `projects/[id]/route.ts` lines 20-23); schedule blocks (`schedule-blocks/route.ts` line 44, `schedule-blocks/[id]/route.ts` line 58) and time entries (`time-entries/route.ts` lines 18 and 53, via `src/lib/timer.ts` line 35) write `taskId`. None looks the target up with the caller's `userId`.",
    "observation": "author-recorded",
    "aiTag": false
